{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7df490f3-6153-8749-8e7d-aec2d85ce537",
  "created_at": "2026-03-12T11:50:48-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Diane Lombardozzi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:49:33-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:49:38-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. I'm calling about a dog. There's a stray dog roaming my street, it's been out there two days now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:49:46-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Do you know if it has a collar or tags?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:49:50-04:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I couldn't tell you, it won't let me get close. Medium size, brownish. Oh, and by the way, my father keeps a paper phone book and swears by it, he said look up animal control in there, but the number he found was disconnected. So I figured I'd call here. Anyway, who actually responds to this kind of thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:09-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would be animal control. They're dispatched through the city. I can take the details and pass it along. What's the location?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:17-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's at 139 Gidley Street. In the Fifth Ward. It keeps going up and down the block."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:23-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 139 Gidley. And a name and callback number, in case the officer needs more information?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:29-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Diane Lombardozzi. 401-555-0151."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:31-04:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Diane. I'll send that over to animal control right now. Is the dog acting aggressive at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:38-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, just wandering. Not aggressive."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:41-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll note that. Someone will follow up with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-12T11:50:45-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thank you. Bye now."
    }
  ],
